{"id":"4e04cbefb6776d1b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md","title":"Silver Indiscernibles","display":"thm-silver-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles","aliases":["58-thm-silver-indiscernibles","Silver Indiscernibles","L-Indiscernibles"],"display":"thm-silver-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles","depends_on":["[[58-thm-0-sharp]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-silver-indiscernibles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-silver-indiscernibles</span><span>Silver Indiscernibles</span><span>L-Indiscernibles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-silver-indiscernibles — Silver Indiscernibles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"58-thm-0-sharp\">58-thm-0-sharp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\">\\(\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"58-thm-0-sharp\">58-thm-0-sharp</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为可构造宇宙（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为序数类</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\)</span> 为元语言中的类存在量词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\\)</span> 分别表示真类性及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\in)\">\\((L,\\in)\\)</span> 的不可辨识性</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 与类满意关系采用书内编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 在这里保持原文“对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\in)\">\\((L,\\in)\\)</span> 的序不可辨识性”约定，由下式展开；真类条件仍由主结论另外给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver\\text{-}indiscernibles}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\to\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}} I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\n\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}silver\\text{-}indiscernibles}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\to\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}} I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\n\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq L\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in V^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec b)\\subseteq I\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(\\vec a(i)\\in\\vec a(j)\\land\\vec b(i)\\in\\vec b(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec b(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq L\\cap\\mathrm{Ord}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\n\\forall\\vec a,\\vec b\\in V^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec b)\\subseteq I\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\;(\\vec a(i)\\in\\vec a(j)\\land\\vec b(i)\\in\\vec b(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,\\varphi,\\{\\langle v_i,\\vec b(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Silver: discovered indiscernibles (1970s).</li>\n<li>Key: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^\\sharp\">\\(0^\\sharp\\)</span> = theory of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> at indiscernibles.</li>\n<li>任意两个同长度的严格递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-元组在结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\in)\">\\((L,\\in)\\)</span> 中满足相同的一阶公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是真类，因此存在量词在类理论的元语言中量化类，而不是把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 当作 ZFC 的集合变量。</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:L\\to L\">\\(j:L\\to L\\)</span> is nontrivial, the critical sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle \\kappa,j(\\kappa),j^2(\\kappa),\\ldots\\rangle\">\\(\\langle \\kappa,j(\\kappa),j^2(\\kappa),\\ldots\\rangle\\)</span> yields indiscernibles.</li>\n<li>The constructible universe is generated as the Skolem hull of the indiscernibles.</li>\n<li>Indiscernibles: ordinals that &quot;look same&quot; to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications: inner model theory, covering lemma analysis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-0-sharp","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-0-sharp","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文",